{
  "about": "Gate D.3 chat membership vectors (V3.2 execution plan §4, D-25). A small fictional site: block A (floors 1 and 2) and block B (floor 1). Each case lists the facts in force, the reader and the groups they must (and must not) be in, with the moment they joined. Groups come only from facts: occupancy for site/block/floor, committee terms, staff roles, a custom group's audience.",
